    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1129">

                <pb facs="0941" n="825" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg825"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/14592.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Consul Garrett</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-03-20">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 20, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your March 14, 8 p.m. State of Texas having consented, permission is hereby
                    granted General Ricaut to transport wounded soldiers to Matamoros. Cost of
                    transportation over Texas soil and other expenses to be borne by General
                    Ricaut.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
